+/// The largest `ka:f` Logan publishes. Cuttlefish2 caps its (k+1)-mer counts (Logan
+/// Unitigs.md, "Theoretical guarantees") and the k-mer value is a half-sum of them; every
+/// accession measured tops out at exactly 25000.0 with hundreds of unitigs piled there
+/// (SRR8209082: 802 of 81,534; SRR6251967, SRR6007473, ERR2028820 likewise), none above.
+pub const KA_CEILING: f32 = 25_000.0;
